Olympian Udita Duhan on Breaking Barriers in Indian Hockey

In an exclusive conversation with Taruka Srivastav, Udita Duhan reflects on being the highest-bought player in the Hockey India League and the importance of such platforms for women in the sport. She shares the heartbreak of hockey’s exclusion from the CWG, her personal struggles, and how she’s inspired other girls to take up hockey, with her biggest source of strength being her mother. 

