I never dreamt of a wedding or that "say yes to the dress" moment like most. Honestly I used to say I'd never even get married and I really believed it.🫣
 That changed when I fell in love with Viviana Hernandez. I started to see my, our future in a completely different light. For whatever reason I still didn't have wedding visions, especially after getting married during COVID because we were together and that's all that mattered to me.🙃
I couldn't fathom how I would feel celebrating us with all our friends and close family. This is why I'm STILL floored at the amazing, FUN, beautiful, special time we had together! Words don't really explain the level of appreciation and gratitude I have for my parents, sister, and everyone else who contributed to make our wedding truly special.🥹
After months of living busy and being in love, here are some of our wedding memories!!🍾💍
THANK YOU to everyone who showed and to everyone who has been rooting for us these ten years! This is only the beginning, and I wouldn't want to do life with anyone else! 💜
.
.
And to the incredible team that helped us bring this vision to life!🍾👰🏽‍♀️💍🤘🏼💜👏🏽💯
